        "description": "Squingle is the ultimate Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game. \nNavigate glass-like mazes called ‘Squingles,’ guiding orbs while avoiding edges and collecting points. Discover why it’s a critically acclaimed 5-star masterpiece!\n\n- 10/10 - “The perfect VR game.” ~ Zimtok5\n- 93% - “A masterpiece.” ~ RuffTalkVR\n- 91% - “One of a kind.” ~ VRGameCritic\n- “Brilliantly creative” ~ RoadToVR\n\n# ✨ 100 LEVELS AND MORE TO COME\nLaunching with 100 levels, with more added over time. Levels grow complex, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.\n\n# 🌈 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or immersive modes.\n\n# 🧩 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n# 😌 RELAX & UNWIND\nPlay on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle’s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.\n\n# FEATURES\n\n- Level Add-ons: New puzzles soon.\n- Mixed Reality: Augmented or immersive modes.\n- Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.\n- Hand Tracking support.\n- Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!\n- Race your ghost: Beat your best times.\n\n# 🏅 AWARDS\nBest VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist\nFinalist ~ QLDXR Festival\n“Best of the Quest” ~ Gibby’s Guide\n\nGet ready to be Squingled!",
